"You have a Hibernate ORM-based application? You want to provide a full-"
"featured full-text search to your users? You're at the right place."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With this guide, you'll learn how to synchronize your entities to an "
"Elasticsearch or OpenSearch cluster in a heartbeat with Hibernate Search.\n"
"We will also explore how you can query your Elasticsearch or OpenSearch "
"cluster using the Hibernate Search API."
msgstr ""

