"We need to tell Hibernate Search about the version of Elasticsearch we will "
"use.\n"
"It is important because there are significant differences between "
"Elasticsearch mapping syntax depending on the version.\n"
"Since the mapping is created at build time to reduce startup time, Hibernate "
"Search cannot connect to the cluster to automatically detect the version.\n"
"Note that, for OpenSearch, you need to prefix the version with `opensearch:"
"`; see <<opensearch>>."
