msgid ""
"For development and tests, we rely on <<dev-services,Dev Services>>,\n"
"which means Quarkus will start a PostgreSQL database and Elasticsearch "
"cluster automatically.\n"
"In production mode, however,\n"
"you will want to start a PostgreSQL database and Elasticsearch cluster "
"manually,\n"
"which is why we provide Quarkus with this connection info in the `prod` "
"profile (`%prod.` prefix)."
msgstr ""

