"Hibernate Search's expectations."
msgstr ""

msgid "validate"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Validate that indexes exist and that their schema matches Hibernate Search's "
"expectations.\n"
"\n"
"If it does not, throw an exception, but make no attempt to fix the problem."
msgstr ""

msgid "create"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For indexes that do not exist, create them along with their schema.\n"
"\n"
"For indexes that already exist, do nothing: assume that their schema matches "
"Hibernate Search's expectations."
msgstr ""

msgid "create-or-validate (**default** unless using Dev Services)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For indexes that do not exist, create them along with their schema.\n"
"\n"
"For indexes that already exist, validate that their schema matches Hibernate "
"Search's expectations.\n"
"\n"
"If it does not, throw an exception, but make no attempt to fix the problem."
